{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-22",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "老大约你喝茶了吗  (Did the Boss Invite You for Tea?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On his way out to DTS with Xingzi the next morning, Kaiwen stops Bu Xiaogu in the corridor with urgent tasks—and two burning pieces of office gossip. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思凯文哥，我今天上班有点晚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我跟杏子今天又被电视台叫去汇报改版方案了，一整天不在公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有几个重要的事你需要落实一下，而且必须今天办。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我还有一个特别重要的事要问你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听说那个粉丝团头子昨天来公司，跟你表白了是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有啊，这是谁跟你说的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一部的同事都看见了，而且老大当时也在场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们太八卦了，那个人脑子本来就不正常，绝对没有！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没有就好，那老大约你喝茶了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没约啊，他为什么要约我喝茶？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不应该啊，他昨天明明说要约你喝茶的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那他可能是觉得喝茶太俗了吧，打算约点别的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那行，你就当我没问过，要有什么下文记得告诉我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行，我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思凯文哥，我今天上班有点晚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry, Kaiwen, I got to work a little late today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我跟杏子今天又被电视台叫去汇报改版方案了，一整天不在公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi and I were called back to the station today to present the revamp plan, so we will be out all day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有几个重要的事你需要落实一下，而且必须今天办。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There are several important matters you need to follow through on, and they must be done today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我还有一个特别重要的事要问你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I also have one extra-important question to ask you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听说那个粉丝团头子昨天来公司，跟你表白了是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard that fan-club leader came to the company yesterday and confessed his feelings to you—is that true?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有啊，这是谁跟你说的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way—who told you that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一部的同事都看见了，而且老大当时也在场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Colleagues in Unit One all saw it, and the boss was right there at the time too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们太八卦了，那个人脑子本来就不正常，绝对没有！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They gossip way too much—that guy is out of his mind anyway; there is definitely nothing between us!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没有就好，那老大约你喝茶了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good thing there is not—so has the boss asked you out for tea yet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没约啊，他为什么要约我喝茶？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, he has not—why would he ask me out for tea?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不应该啊，他昨天明明说要约你喝茶的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That should not be; yesterday he clearly talked about asking you out for tea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那他可能是觉得喝茶太俗了吧，打算约点别的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe he decided tea sounded too cliché and plans to invite you to something else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那行，你就当我没问过，要有什么下文记得告诉我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright then, pretend I never asked—and if anything happens next, remember to tell me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行，我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, got it.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思凯文哥，我今天上班有点晚了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我跟杏子今天又被电视台叫去汇报改版方案了，一整天不在公司。",
      "gap": 0.5
